{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "68366dde8ae4df01f299bc1da8fc8bd3ea853c49315d33f223b55000f1d17d2e", "ja": "（『なんどでも笑おう』のPR活動の一環で、\nミニライブを開催した！　いい宣伝になったはずだ）", "zh": "（作为《无论多少次都要欢笑》的宣传活动之一，举办了一场迷你演唱会！应该起到了很好的宣传效果）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "1e934b575f196aac5f70395339576487046d8d97afedfb9e107f3396886fba1a", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\nステージ、うまくいきましたね。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n舞台进行得很顺利呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7613c7314d6ee5fd956458efe4915623aa4abfacd1a89da6309dd35b00ab71a8", "ja": "お疲れさま！　そうだな、いいライブだった。\nこの調子で本番もよろしく！", "zh": "辛苦了！是啊，演出很成功。\n正式演出也请照这个势头加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "d452a5c2fb598d7df5b3a50bebd3b1e9dd671bdd9fad926daa14d59b226ae1c7", "ja": "はい、もちろんです！\n……。えっと、それで……コホン。", "zh": "是的，当然！\n……那个，接下来……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "e4035cd682b6c80504b963d6e5648f938d213647728aca265de9cc36a6db72d9", "ja": "あの……このあと、時間ありますか？\n少し付き合って欲しいんですけど。", "zh": "那个……这之后，您有时间吗？\n想让您陪我一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e4798a3c245bb64ca593c2920c8757f3b977f0a693346407b7f923fce11d51b8", "ja": "うん？　まあ……劇場に帰るだけだから、\n大丈夫だけど。どこか行きたいのか？", "zh": "嗯？这个嘛……反正只是回剧场，\n倒是没关系。你想去什么地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "05ac229b34037f7afd4bf638a5271fb2aa90e4936a0c7d238c1e3ff59c32a161", "ja": "近くの喫茶店で、今だけ限定の紅茶が飲めるみたい\nなんです。なので……寄ってみようかなって。", "zh": "听说附近的咖啡店能喝到现在限定的红茶。所以……我想要不要去坐坐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1007_p", "source_sha256": "386c270382468092e2ab01f1a8dd3e9b2930a8b4868aa8874dcb98da19f83ae5", "ja": "へえ？　いいけど、静香がそういうの\n誘ってくれるなんて、珍しいな。どうしたんだ？", "zh": "哦？可以是可以，不过静香居然会邀请我做这种事，还真少见啊。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "924649792ba9687e07880ddb6aacb54106a31ed49023f89c543d99ee90ca05a0", "ja": "べ、別にどうもしません。\nイヤなら別にいいですっ！", "zh": "没、没什么。  \n你不愿意的话就算了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1009_p", "source_sha256": "edcc920c95786599af2687ff5742cac11de9b1fb808a34e60e3226f236b8a70c", "ja": "ごめんごめん、全然イヤじゃないよ。\n本番前の息抜きにもなるだろうし、いってみよう。", "zh": "抱歉抱歉，我完全不讨厌哦。\n而且也能当作正式演出前的放松，那就去看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a632a2bea54d00931453e9b4c7fdc113e0695114547080ee0d6e9570d2005fae", "ja": "それにしても……静香、最近は何か、こう……\n余裕みたいなものが出てきたんじゃないか？", "zh": "不过话说回来……静香，你最近是不是有点……怎么说呢……\n感觉比以前从容多了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "d50c9a172e719601db40e7f8d7edf5ea70b3fd53578819b13cd3db58915197a0", "ja": "そう、ですか？　まあ……そうかもしれません。\n落ち着いたっていうか、なんていうか……。", "zh": "是吗？嗯……也许吧。\n该说是变得沉稳了，还是怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "ef01efc1006f827edfc879c8e258e79380aa5e20772c7527f4f64eab8215774c", "ja": "もちろん、目標はまだまだ遠いし、凄いライバルも\nたくさんいますから、気は抜けませんけど。", "zh": "当然，目标还差得很远，而且还有许多强大的对手，不能掉以轻心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8a66bb843028a6ca9d5e11f70308220782f6886528a25420edfd0dcd439b782d", "ja": "そうだなぁ。今回の合同ライブで改めて思ったけど、\n魅力的なアイドルってたくさんいるよな。", "zh": "是啊。这次的联合演唱会让我再次意识到，魅力十足的偶像真是有很多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "2009beca7fe545374265bde9d3663783437e90fe27c9a7c278f6a5ab12a59ba5", "ja": "はい、私も思いました。\nこの世界にいるのは、私たちだけじゃないんだ、って。", "zh": "是的，我也这么想。\n这个世界上，并不只有我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "edbf0c99d68f5ef7eb6834af1887b323f5706266d671607f7427d153c28d22f7", "ja": "たくさんのアイドルがいて、それぞれのやり方で、\nみんな……トップを目指してるんだな、なんて。", "zh": "这里有许多偶像，大家都在用各自的方式……朝着顶峰努力呢，我这么想着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "f72efcd75d5d16b5a2f006dafc3059fcb0ef8bfaa55bd794413be05f0de4b47c", "ja": "でも私、だからこそ……きちんと一歩ずつ、\n近づいていきたいです。……トップアイドルに。", "zh": "但正因为如此……我才想脚踏实地，一步一步地接近……顶尖偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1017_p", "source_sha256": "86fabce30deac7e162ba55605544ed8dacb2cc1c974f4106c6525a6017e86103", "ja": "うん、いいプランだと思う！\n俺もそのつもりで、しっかりプロデュースするよ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得这个计划很好！\n我也会带着这份心意，好好为你制作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f99584015b9a696d3b696760acc653f35aa9589e599c5a45915b975c9d2699c5", "ja": "……あれ？　ところで、未来と翼には\n声掛けなくていいのか？　喫茶店。", "zh": "……咦？话说回来，不用叫上未来和翼吗？去咖啡店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "d3e18365887ce2880e0059440dd76c50a3626627f719e2336b3e943a545c6d8b", "ja": "え？　未来と翼？　どう……っ！！", "zh": "诶？未来和翼？怎、怎么……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "bae7b2d583e5113e86befcdc227ab963b88cc653a7253818378d1067f1922739", "ja": "か、掛けます、当り前じゃないですか！　ただあの\n二人は、来るに決まってるから聞かなかっただけで…！", "zh": "当、当然要打电话啊，这不是理所当然的吗！只不过那两个人肯定会来的，所以才没问而已……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0223_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "08d7d257172356bd0c161a468337f2707b68a75a73553ff5276197b97879f2dc", "ja": "だから、変な勘違いしないでくださいね！\nそれじゃ……呼んできます！", "zh": "所以，请不要产生奇怪的误会！\n那么……我去叫他们过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
